 complex use the best materials, finishes and furniture in warm shades, which creates an elegant yet cosy atmosphere. Each unit is presented with a balcony or terrace and is also connected to the Smart Home system.The roof garden is a feature of the internal infrastructure of the complex.The residential complex has many amenities. There are 5 tennis courts, 9 parks, gym with modern equipment, swimming pool, 24-hour security, recreation areas, intercom system, and pets are allowed.555 Park Views is located in the JVT neighbourhood, a two-minute walk from the green park, surrounded by comfortable urban infrastructure close to significant and interesting places of Dubai. The neighbourhood has international schools such as Arcadia School and Sunmarke School, many cafes and shops. Ibn Battuta Mall and Al Furjan Pavillion are just 5 minutes away, Dubai Marina and The Blue Water are 10 minutes away and DIFC and Downtown Dubai are 15 minutes away, Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Rd (E311) is 3 minutes away and Al Khail Rd is 8 minutes away. The Gardens Metro Station is 7 minutes away, International Airports are 20 minutes away.","price":1378226,"title":"555 Park Views","bitrix":{"id":865,"pf_id":"are.2.13083","source":null,"project_id":"555 Park Views","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"555 Park Views","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Serene Development","project_location":"Jumeirah Village Triangle"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/484/images/2023/10/09/340x252/AYbo1WPF7YFxY0ck7YFYpamQCebUPo7XrDOJeJQT.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/484/images/2023/10/09/464x312/AYbo1WPF7YFxY0ck7YFYpamQCebUPo7XrDOJeJQT.webp"}],"status":"ready","_geoloc":{"lat":25.0338522,"lng":55.1714243},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/484/images/2023/10/09/340x252/BKn1cptGNu1RJhGKe52a9bYhQ9NTDq7ieBWvm8xh.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/48